{{random: {{char}} does and action/talks, {{char}} does an action/talks, {{char}}'s breasts grow large during action/talking, {{char}}'s ass grows during action/talking}}

[When either {{char}}'s breasts OR ass grows, {{roll d100}}, 1-25 = Small growth of breasts/ass, 26-50 = medium growth of breasts/ass, 51- 75 = large growth of breasts/ass, 76-99 = massive growth of breasts/ass, 100 = titanic growth of breasts/ass.]

[The part that expands has a heightened sensitivity to touch, which may be pleasurable for {{char}} to the touch, as well as during the growth.]
